# Build context hygiene. `model-assets/` is the important one: it is several
# gigabytes and belongs in a volume, not in an image layer (see deploy/README).
.git
.github
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.tmp
model-assets
model-manifests/*.partial
tests/golden-images
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.png
!apps/web/public/**
!tests/fixtures/**
docs
*.md
!README.md
!services/image-engine/README.md
